  "details": "Description\n\n\"View All\" button in Groups block in own Profile will be not displayed if hide all groups and keep visible less than 6\n\nReproduction Steps\n\n1. Open Quick Menu\n\n2. Open own profile\n\n3. Select any group\n\n4. Open group settings\n\n5. Change visibility to Hidden\n\n6. Repeat steps 2 to 5 until fewer than 6 visible groups remain\n\n7. Open own profile\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p1-1920-5a72154dad-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-08_16-04-14.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_7194f92f-5101-42dd-9cbd-9ee789818152/1/file)",
